why not? If you run into something that will curse your items - that
means the first time the wand gets it then it will only be uncursed.
Wands that are cursed have a 1% chance of exploding when zapped.

> It also says wish for an uncursed magic marker.  Why not blessed? (I'm
> thinking so you can write cursed scrolls...)

yep, uncursed magic marker can make all types of scrolls so it's more
versatile. If you know you're only going to be writing blessed scrolls
then you can wish for a blessed magic marker.

